# The shell and file exercises are GENERATED: generators/exNN.sh is the answer,
# and deliverable/exNN/ is rebuilt from it (bazel run :generate), so it is never
# committed. Per exercise, not the whole deliverable/: this project also holds
# the hand-written C exercises, which are.
/deliverable/ex00/
/deliverable/ex01/
/deliverable/ex02/
/deliverable/ex03/
/deliverable/ex04/
/deliverable/ex05/

# What a hand-run `make` or `cc -o` leaves behind (object files and libft.a
# are already ignored repo-wide; these executables have no extension to match
# on). //tools:conventions holds this list to every program the BUILD file
# names, as it does the root .gitignore.
/deliverable/ex18/ft_print_params
/deliverable/ex19/ft_sort_params
/deliverable/ex27/ft_display_file
